      "title": "‘The engine’s on fire’: Qantas flight from Queenstown to Sydney reroutes after flames seen by passengers",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/06/qantas-flight-queenstown-to-sydney-rerouted-flames-seen-by-passengers",
      "description": "<p>Passenger recalls seeing cabin lights flicker and ‘a lot of screaming’ after suspected engine issue</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>Liza-Jayne Loch was returning home from a business trip to New Zealand when her <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/business/qantas\">Qantas</a> flight ran into trouble.</p><p>The plane was climbing above the scenic South Island’s mountain ranges on Saturday afternoon, bound for Sydney, when a bang shook the cabin.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/2026/sep/06/qantas-flight-queenstown-to-sydney-rerouted-flames-seen-by-passengers\">Continue reading...</a>",
